{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも。こんにちわかつきっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/31/3742433/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊告知"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月6日（木）日本テレビ系 「ダウンタウンDX」に出演致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で出演なので良かったら是非是非見ていただきたいですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊発見"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故かみおながコメントしてくれたらしい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/31/3742433/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうっ！！直接言ってくれても良いのになんだか嬉しいよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ピックアップでコメントお返します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、早稲田祭出ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆出ますよん☻！！来てくださる皆さんお待ちしてますっ！髪型何にしようかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、全国握手会のペアは能條さんなんですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆そうなのっ！あみとは何回か一緒になってて！あみあみ族の皆さんよろしくお願いします！ちなみに、あみ情報書いとくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・10月誕生日でしたよ・引き寄せの法則・カワハギに似てるらしい・髪を暗くしたよ・ヤンキー企画のラッパー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➕  若月の話題も書いとくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・舞台千秋楽迎えました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ヴァンパイア騎士決まりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・応援団のコスプレしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、今見ているドラマある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ファーストクラス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ごめんね青春！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・信長協奏曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ディア・シスター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・きょうは会社休みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかかな？書き出したら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外にいっぱい見てたなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でお話しましょー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週はいっぱいみんなと会えるねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会もミニライブやるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山、乃木充してね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーハロウィンヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃねんヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/31/3742433/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.うわぁぁぁあ。ななみんドレス着てたぁぁぁあ。ね、ななみん？とか言ってたのにぃぃ。羨ましい。笑"}],"source":"archive"}